<http://data.silknow.org/object/09d5d47b-8ac1-33cf-9435-9c7ef05a926e>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Panel, possibly made from a cape.  Three breadths of green velvet, brocaded with gold, sewed together, ends and lower corners made of small pieces.  Design:  undulating stems bearing large leaves and conventionalized fruit and foliage forms, pomegranate/pinecones.  Velvet, two heights of pile, small areas in uncut piles, gold loops, and flat gold brocading.  Worn, some wax stains.\n11 fragments removed 8/72"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/d5afb5ef-bcf7-3753-9728-f1d4b49928ca> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Panel, possibly made from a cape.  Three breadths of green velvet, brocaded with gold, sewed together, ends and lower corners made of small pieces.  Design:  undulating stems bearing large leaves and conventionalized fruit and foliage forms, pomegranate/pinecones.  Velvet, two heights of pile, small areas in uncut piles, gold loops, and flat gold brocading.  Worn, some wax stains.\n11 fragments removed 8/72"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/09d5d47b-8ac1-33cf-9435-9c7ef05a926e/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/09d5d47b-8ac1-33cf-9435-9c7ef05a926e/dimension/1> ;
